---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="BORP Summer Cycling Program 2026" description="Group handcycle rides in San Jose with BORP, including advanced long-distance electric-assist rides with Able Bodied.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Group rides</p>
      <h1>BORP Summer Cycling Program 2026</h1>
      <p class="lead">BORP is hosting 16 group rides in San Jose in 2026, from pick-your-own-adventure manual rides to 30+ mile electric-assist group rides.</p>
      <p><strong>South Bay residents</strong> can have the $25 BORP membership fee waived: email <a href="mailto:info@borp.org">info@borp.org</a> with your address.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn accent" href="https://forms.gle/EHX7SRTLW4utywUW6">Sign up today</a>
      </div>

      <h2 class="mt">Advanced rides with Able Bodied</h2>
      <p>Able Bodied is partnering with BORP on three longer “advanced” rides. The first was a 38-mile ride to Los Altos (<a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/muqLjgzTN9vva9tt9">pictures</a>). To sign up for an advanced long-distance electric-assist ride, please first have at least one <a href="/#lessons">one-on-one lesson</a> with Able Bodied.</p>

      <h2 class="mt">Ride schedule</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="embed">
        <iframe
          src="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vSx6xt0ZpOLojfDp6j7DtOBp-FSqoTNx7k6EBbM9070Z6uhPPxz6NgxwmTSmLoRdBdaW5DN3BDO1K3L/pubhtml?widget=true&headers=false"
          title="BORP 2026 ride schedule"
          loading="lazy"></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .mt {
    margin-top: 2em;
  }
  .embed iframe {
    min-height: 640px;
  }
</style>
